### Health check
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/health?x=1
Accept: application/json

### Get a user ({{user_id}} comes from the env file)
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users/{{user_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a user (POST with JSON body)
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "job": "tester"
}

### Local test server — start it with: python3 tests/server.py
GET http://127.0.0.1:8999/api?x=1
